__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LINES",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}});const n={wake:['Oi Kannan! Two kosong, one tissue!','Oi Kannan, wake up lah, the tawa already smoking!','Wah, dream until forget to flip ah? Wake up!','Kannan, your teh-O getting cold, customer waiting sia.','Aiyo Kannan, roaches again ah? Come back, the sambal boiling!','Oi Kannan, you sweat more than the tawa lah. Wake up!','Kannan! Daydream cannot pay the rent, come back to work!','Oi Raja, the counter needs you more than the throne!','Kannan, put down the spatula sword, customer wants egg!','Walao Kannan, you flip the air, not the prata!','Oi Kannan, ice kacang melting, prata burning, wake up!','Kannan, auntie say her roti still raw, come quick!','Oi Kannan! Two plain, one egg, one dhal, go go go!','Wake up sia, the ants already taking the sugar!','Kannan, a roach sitting in the sugar jar, deal with it!','Oi Kannan! Your daydream very long, customers very hungry lah!','Kannan, morning rush starting, stop daydreaming!','Oi Kannan, how many times I call you already?','Kannan, the tawa cannot flip itself, your prata must!','Oi Kannan! Breakfast waiting, the Raja can come later.'],win:['Oi Kannan, why you smiling at the tawa?','Wah, whole street queue finish already! Shiok lah, Kannan.','Kannan, the ants all run home. Auntie say your prata very power.','Walao, you really cook them all? Teh-O on the house, boss.','Roaches all run away already, Kannan. Proud of you, boy.','Breakfast saved! Now go sit down, your back also need rest, ah.','Oi Kannan, stall still standing and you still smiling. Good lah.','Kannan, see? Daydream also can make money. Now go wash the tawa.'],tips:['Kosong ricochets to the next enemy from L3.','Tissue pierce and lobs (Roti Bomb, Naan) bypass Tiffin Beetle shields.','Sambal turns every burning enemy into a bomb on death.','Five Diabetes stacks trigger a 1 s Sugar Crash. Plan around the stun.','Monsoon slows you too. Train Quick Feet before Monsoon Alley.','Raja gear cannot be merged. Equip it, do not hoard it.','Three identical items of one rarity merge into the next tier.','Vadai circle the counter front and hit anything that reaches it.','Shooters aim at where you stand, so keep moving between throws.','Dhal heals per kill and Kopi Break adds regen. Stack both for long runs.']}},1894,[]);
